# Default-deny the build context. The development image copies only the
# application, tests, and explicitly named project metadata below.
**
!Dockerfile
!.dockerignore
!pyproject.toml
!README.md
!LICENSE
!CONTRIBUTING.md
!conftest.py
!requirements.txt
!drivers.yaml
!drivers.rpi.yaml
!cognistore/
!cognistore/**
!tests/
!tests/**
!docker/
!docker/**

# Never re-include generated files or credential-shaped files nested beneath
# an allowlisted source directory.
**/__pycache__
**/*.py[cod]
**/.pytest_cache
**/.mypy_cache
**/.ruff_cache
**/.env
**/.env.*
**/.envrc
**/.netrc
**/.pypirc
**/.aws
**/*.key
**/*.pem
**/id_ed25519*
**/id_rsa*
**/secrets.*
**/*.db
**/*.db-*
**/*.sqlite
**/*.sqlite3
**/*.log
